      "created_at": "2015-04-02T05:54:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"AlexxKay\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> AlexxKay:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>While testing some bugfixes in the App, I got a Cohort down to -50 HP.&nbsp; A bit later I walloped Matriarch down to -41.&nbsp; If I'd spent a little more time on it, I could have got her down to -49, but I'd already spent a long time on that game and wanted to move on :-)I'm curious if anyone else has seen numbers that low in actual games?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If we're talking with Fixed Point in play then AZ can hit -whatever with isothermic transducer and imbued fire/twist the ether.</p>\n<p>Without, you're talking a lot less.</p>",
